    {
      "q": "How can I report a problem with a parking sign?",
      "a": "You can report a problem using an online form, by calling 131 700, or through other contact methods.",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "q": "What information do I need to report a problem?",
      "a": "You should have the location of the parking sign, details of the problem, and a photo of the sign (in .jpg or .png format). Providing your personal contact information is optional.",
